Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:01:32.99,0:01:33.03,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:03:04.04,0:03:04.08,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:09:06.03,0:09:06.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
Comment: 50,0:22:27.95,0:22:27.99,Default,chptr,0,0,0,edsync,ED
Dialogue: 50,0:00:29.51,0:00:31.72,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I wonder if Fuu's already up.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.31,0:00:35.31,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Dad!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:35.31,0:00:37.06,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Ah, take care.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:43.31,0:00:45.07,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see you perform!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:45.07,0:00:47.07,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:49.86,0:00:51.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm going to sing my heart out!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:53.16,0:00:55.12,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:02.96,0:01:03.96,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.18,0:01:17.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I missed it...
Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.10,0:01:18.35,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,You'll be late?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:18.35,0:01:21.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Nah, I'll be fine. I got up early.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:23.10,0:01:26.15,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You think big sis will watch the concert?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:26.15,0:01:27.73,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:27.73,0:01:30.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I mean, she's a fan of Lilly!\NAnd there's a livestream.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.43,0:03:23.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Is the coast clear?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.27,0:03:26.10,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Letto.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.23,0:03:28.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I made it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.61,0:03:31.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Here will do.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:32.57,0:03:34.32,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.40,0:03:36.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Litto!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.34,0:03:55.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Pam pam power!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.59,0:03:57.34,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila, pululila!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.34,0:04:00.01,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Pop'n pam!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.08,0:04:31.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's go, Azuki!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.33,0:04:31.88,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.04,0:04:35.00,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,You're so reckless...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.38,0:04:37.47,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,It's LuluttoLilly's first concert!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.47,0:04:38.59,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.59,0:04:40.26,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,I heard their tickets sold out!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.26,0:04:41.68,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,That's crazy.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.68,0:04:43.72,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,I've never been to a concert before.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.72,0:04:44.97,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Me neither!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.97,0:04:47.73,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,I hope it's alright for middle schoolers to be here...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.73,0:04:52.15,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Don't see why not. Kadoya-kun and his friend\Nfrom the basketball club are here.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.77,0:04:56.65,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,That girl is amazing...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.90,0:05:00.03,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,She's one passionate superfan.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.03,0:05:01.41,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,So cool.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.24,0:05:05.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,My disguise is perfect!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.99,0:05:07.50,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Why me too?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.50,0:05:11.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Check it out, Uguisu!\NThere's so many people here!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.12,0:05:14.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I feel like a big star.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.63,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.63,0:05:18.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, Lulu-chan's fans are here too.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.59,0:05:25.18,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,What a big building.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.18,0:05:25.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.89,0:05:32.94,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.19,0:05:35.57,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.57,0:05:37.44,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.36,0:05:44.07,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Man, who knew they'd form a unit! That rocks!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.07,0:05:45.87,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,For real. I didn't see it coming.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.87,0:05:48.24,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,They're just such a crazy dream team!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.58,0:05:51.71,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Dude, take it down a notch.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.25,0:05:55.29,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Hey, you were looking forward to this too.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.21,0:05:58.55,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Yeah... a little, I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.55,0:06:03.51,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Don't gimme that, Shota. You told me\Nyou were so excited you couldn't sleep last night.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.51,0:06:04.89,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Did not!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.89,0:06:06.97,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh? Shota-kun?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.47,0:06:09.56,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,So, who's your favorite?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.27,0:06:13.73,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,In LuluttoLilly, I mean!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.73,0:06:16.06,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Which one do you like better,\NLulu or Lilly?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.19,0:06:19.90,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Surely Lilly, since you got her autograph, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.90,0:06:21.94,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Um, I dunno...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.94,0:06:24.99,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,So you like Lulu better, since she's mature?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.99,0:06:27.37,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Dude, it's not... I...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.37,0:06:28.58,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Who's your pick?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.25,0:06:33.16,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.16,0:06:34.62,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,L-Lu...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.83,0:06:37.54,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thanks for your support!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.25,0:06:42.13,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,L-Lu-Lululu—!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.55,0:06:48.51,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,Dang...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.47,0:06:51.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.77,Default,Staff 1,0,0,0,,Lilly-san, best of luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.06,0:06:58.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.56,0:07:00.27,Default,Staff 2/3,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.36,0:07:03.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Morning, Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.32,0:07:06.24,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.57,0:07:07.66,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.66,0:07:08.95,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,In it to win it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.95,0:07:09.74,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.16,0:07:12.75,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Prez, have you checked the guest list?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.75,0:07:17.00,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have. I'll give them my regards soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:17.00,0:07:18.13,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Where's Lulu?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.13,0:07:20.38,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Already in the greenroom.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.38,0:07:22.34,Default,Staff 4,0,0,0,,Can we have a moment?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.34,0:07:25.93,Default,Staff 4,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to use the moving cart?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.93,0:07:28.64,Default,Staff 5,0,0,0,,The venue's packed so it won't move around much.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.60,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Please try and make it work!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.06,0:07:35.31,Default,Staff 4,0,0,0,,Well, we can try to figure something out.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.31,0:07:36.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,If you will!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.15,Default,Staff 5,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.15,0:07:39.86,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Do something! Anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.86,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,{\an8}Well, you can't force it.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.77,0:07:43.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Aww, so cute!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.28,0:07:44.94,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Are those sweets?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.94,0:07:48.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah, macarons! I've always wanted to try these!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.49,0:07:51.74,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.74,0:07:53.70,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm a little nervous.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.58,0:07:59.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's eat these together!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.34,0:08:03.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm sure they taste great!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.80,0:08:06.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,They're so cute.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.84,0:08:08.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.18,0:08:10.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Apparently the president gave us these.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.93,0:08:12.72,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,That's generous of him.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.56,0:08:16.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It'sh yummy!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.98,0:08:18.39,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yesh, very delicious.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.40,0:08:21.98,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Did that calm you down?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.31,0:08:24.73,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes! Now I can finally smile.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.36,0:08:29.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Before, my cheeks were puffed up\Nso my face looked all funny.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.03,0:08:32.70,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I wanna see your funny face!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.70,0:08:34.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It looked kind of like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.67,0:08:42.50,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. We just have to perform\Nlike we always do.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.50,0:08:44.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Just gotta relax.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.47,0:08:53.51,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.39,0:08:56.02,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Isn't that song...?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.77,0:08:59.06,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Are you two ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.06,0:09:00.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We're coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.99,0:09:12.03,Default,Staff 3,0,0,0,,The show will begin shortly!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.45,0:09:14.66,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Whoa, so many people...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.66,0:09:15.95,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's a full house.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.95,0:09:17.54,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That's crazy...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.54,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,All these people watching us...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.54,0:09:25.34,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,All that's left is for you to give it your all,\Nnow that we've gotten this far.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.34,0:09:25.96,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.96,0:09:27.46,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.46,0:09:29.17,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's knock 'em dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.01,0:09:34.80,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lulu.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.30,0:09:38.39,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You have a great singing voice.\NHave some confidence.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.39,0:09:39.56,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.06,0:09:42.81,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,The audience is all snowmen.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.02,0:09:48.07,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Break a leg.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.53,0:09:50.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.82,0:09:53.82,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,All that said, the show's about to start.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.49,0:10:01.46,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Today's concert is a big step\Nto getting us further out there.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.50,0:10:06.75,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You two are going to become\Namazing idols and change the world.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.63,0:10:13.68,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Once...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.68,0:10:15.34,Default,All,0,0,0,,More-More!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.56,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I can't hear you! Once...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.56,0:10:19.43,Default,All,0,0,0,,More-More!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.93,0:10:23.89,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,LuluttoLilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.19,0:10:35.70,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey everyone! Let's blow the roof off this place!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.00,0:10:51.88,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,So cute!{かわいいぞ！}
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.96,0:10:48.42,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}I take off my sneakers, feeling I've grown
Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.42,0:10:51.88,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Bout to head out in my new fit
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.88,0:10:55.22,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Earrings dangling, lip gloss on
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.22,0:10:58.64,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Somehow dazzling even inside
Dialogue: 50,0:10:58.64,0:11:02.18,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}It all seemed like a fairy tale on a screen
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.18,0:11:06.23,Default,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Something far, far away I could never reach
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.35,0:11:10.23,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Everyone! Are you enjoying it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.07,0:11:17.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you for cheering me on so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.53,0:11:22.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,All of you watching the stream,\Nare you excited?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.95,0:11:29.50,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Seeing all your faces makes me think...\NWow, I really am an idol!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.29,0:11:32.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're watching me too!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.46,0:11:37.09,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm singing today for you, my beloved!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.34,0:11:40.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Next up, it's Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.43,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.68,0:11:49.02,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,She's my great friend,\Nand my partner in LuluttoLilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.02,0:11:51.27,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,T-T-Thank you for having me!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.86,0:11:53.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Ain't she a cutie!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Sing for us!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.07,0:11:56.82,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.99,0:12:02.37,Default,Shota,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.21,0:12:15.17,Default,MashuLulu,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Fly up, fly up, fly up, into the great blue sky
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.17,0:12:20.47,Default,MashuLulu,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}The miracle will keep shining up ahead
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.47,0:12:24.85,Default,MashuLulu,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}So don't stop chasing it until you smile
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.85,0:12:27.39,Default,MashuLulu,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Little singing bird
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.02,0:12:30.10,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Keep it up, you two.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.15,0:12:33.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.40,0:12:35.86,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.49,0:12:39.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Once Lulu's part wraps up, it'll be time...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.32,0:12:40.03,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.37,0:12:46.95,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Does this look...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.95,0:12:48.04,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,okay to you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.04,0:12:49.08,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Not one bit.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.08,0:12:52.21,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh?! You should've said so earlier!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.21,0:12:55.13,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,But you clearly wanted to do this.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.21,0:12:59.05,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We can't do it! This cart is a disaster!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.05,0:13:01.59,Default,Seena,0,0,0,,Well, we all made it together.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.14,0:13:03.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.56,0:13:08.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Listen up, girls. We've changed the cart's route.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.64,0:13:09.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.44,0:13:10.73,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.73,0:13:12.69,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Issues with the venue.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.11,0:13:16.03,Default,Staff 2,0,0,0,,We'll send the cart out! Please get on standby!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.03,0:13:16.94,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.95,0:13:21.45,Default,Staff 2/3,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.03,0:13:23.74,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sorry! Good luck!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.78,0:13:29.41,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.66,0:13:28.91,Alt,Rui,0,0,0,,Are you having fun?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.84,0:13:36.50,Default,Mizuka,0,0,0,,Was that it?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.50,0:13:37.59,Default,Momo,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.01,0:13:42.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}Are you all excited?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.01,0:13:44.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\an8}I hope my singing has reached you!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.30,0:13:45.47,Default,Hisashi,0,0,0,,That's... so lame...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.43,0:13:50.73,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This isn't what I pictured!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.73,0:13:52.35,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I knew it'd flop.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.35,0:13:54.56,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Where's all the excitement?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.56,0:13:56.65,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It'll be fine when they start singing.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.65,0:13:58.57,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.32,0:13:58.78,Default,Staff 3,0,0,0,,{\an8}We're bringing the cart back.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.57,0:14:01.70,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,A good concert {\i1}needs{\i0} a moving cart!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.09,0:14:00.40,Alt,Sena,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.70,0:14:04.41,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}We did make this cart together.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.82,0:14:09.87,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lululila, pululila, make this an even better cart!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.42,0:14:22.34,Default,Staff 2/3,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.31,0:14:31.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Last up will be our brand new duet!\NSing along with us!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.60,0:14:33.23,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 51,0:14:49.74,0:14:54.71,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Our meeting was no coincidence{出会えたことは偶然じゃないよ}
Dialogue: 51,0:14:54.71,0:15:01.09,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}We're like two stars connected in a constellation{星と星繋いで星座になってみたいに}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:01.09,0:15:06.09,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}If we had happened to witness it{気まぐれのようで立ち会えたら}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:06.09,0:15:09.81,INS,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Then we'd know now{これって今なら分かるよ}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:09.81,0:15:12.72,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That it was a miracle{奇跡だってね}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.69,INS,CompatoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Let's combine our feelings{気持ちを重ねて}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:15.69,0:15:17.77,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Synchronize our heartbeats{ドキドキシンクロして}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:17.77,0:15:24.40,INS,MashuLulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And let our imaginations grow even wilder{もっとイマジネーション大きく膨らませて}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:22.53,0:15:24.86,INS,CompatoLilly,0,0,140,,{\fad(100,100)}UFO, take us away{連れててUFO}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:24.40,0:15:27.32,INS,MashuLulu,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the sky of love{恋空}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:25.32,0:15:27.32,INS,CompatoLilly,0,0,140,,{\fad(100,100)}We'll soar into the sky{空まで飛べる}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:27.32,0:15:28.74,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Magical
Dialogue: 51,0:15:28.74,0:15:33.79,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Even the dreams I cannot reach{手の届かない夢だって}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:33.79,0:15:38.58,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}So long as you're with me, I can make them happen{一緒だったら with me\N叶えられてそう}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:38.58,0:15:40.25,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Universe
Dialogue: 51,0:15:40.25,0:15:44.63,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Please stay with me, don't leave{離れないでついていてね}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:44.63,0:15:47.63,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}We're gentle shooting stars, love{ふわっと流れ星Love}
Dialogue: 51,0:15:47.63,0:15:52.76,INS,LuluttoLilly,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Taking a rendezvous on a crescent moon{三日月座ってランデブー}
