Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.15,0:16:08.16,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sena...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.91,0:16:09.78,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.03,0:16:13.99,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I think I...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.29,0:16:16.83,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,{\i1}do{\i0} want to stand on a stage.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.00,0:16:20.00,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.05,0:16:26.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wasn't that fun, Lulu-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.13,0:16:29.93,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes! I wasn't scared at all\Nsince we were together!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.43,0:16:35.22,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Aw, now it's over.\NI wanted to spend more time with everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.64,0:16:38.48,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Did you all have fun too?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.56,0:16:41.90,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.90,0:16:42.98,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.40,0:16:45.19,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We did great, didn't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.19,0:16:47.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It was tough.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.82,0:16:51.37,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,The folks from Once More helped out a lot too!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.37,0:16:53.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,We wouldn't be here without all of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.99,0:16:56.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I got to meet you all!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.79,0:16:59.00,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This concert was a success!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.58,0:17:02.92,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll never forget this day!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.38,0:17:06.84,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I've grown to love singing even more!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.71,0:17:12.01,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We hope you'll keep on supporting LuluttoLilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.93,0:17:14.85,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,We'd appreciate it!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.02,0:17:19.64,Default,Fuu/Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you all very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.72,0:17:58.64,Default,Idol Fan,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.15,0:18:14.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can't sleep...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.03,0:18:17.20,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,My heart's still racing...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.20,0:18:19.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It all feels so unreal.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.16,0:18:24.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It felt like a dream\Nwhen I used magic for the first time,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.13,0:18:27.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,but today's concert felt like a dream too.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.92,0:18:32.17,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uguisu, how did I do today?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.17,0:18:33.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.47,0:18:36.55,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Does it matter...?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.10,0:18:38.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.14,0:18:42.93,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Cold...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.23,0:18:47.98,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Today was a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.11,0:18:53.65,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I actually transformed\Nand sang in front of everyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.78,0:18:59.62,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san's song pushed me forward that day,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.87,0:19:02.33,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,and now my song...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.04,0:19:05.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,made everyone happy.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.75,0:19:07.96,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It feels like a dream.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.50,0:19:12.84,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Rui, it's cold...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.13,0:19:14.80,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.36,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Big sis.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.02,0:19:31.23,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.23,0:19:32.11,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.61,0:19:34.15,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You're up early.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.15,0:19:36.70,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,So are you. Quite early.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.70,0:19:39.12,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah. Just felt awake.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.16,0:19:46.37,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hey... something good happened to me yesterday.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.21,0:19:48.13,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What was it?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.00,0:19:51.00,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.63,0:19:56.51,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It seems pretty warm out today.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.51,0:19:57.26,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.30,0:20:00.80,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Maybe I should go for a walk.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.51,0:20:02.76,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'll go too!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.22,0:20:06.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Hurry up, big sis!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.14,0:20:06.89,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.86,0:20:18.28,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It feels so good.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.11,0:20:21.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,You look happy, big sis!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.24,0:20:24.87,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Did something good happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.41,0:20:28.29,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes! Can you tell?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.29,0:20:31.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Really? I knew it!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.59,0:20:33.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Go on, tell me!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.84,0:20:35.96,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yesterday...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.63,0:20:40.22,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I dreamed I was flying in the sky.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.97,0:20:44.68,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Guess what? I had the same dream!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.68,0:20:45.77,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You did?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.77,0:20:46.48,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.10,0:20:51.23,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I see! So you and I are the same!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.78,0:21:00.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.16,0:21:09.83,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had never thought about it...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.29,0:21:13.79,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}that there could be other magicians besides me.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.79,0:21:15.00,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Because you see...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.75,0:21:18.26,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can actually use magic!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.63,0:21:22.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Because you see...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.68,0:21:24.72,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can actually use magic!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.89,0:21:26.93,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.56,0:21:28.31,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.02,0:21:31.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I saw these the other day\Nand thought they were cute,
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.60,0:21:33.81,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,so I'm letting you have one!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.31,0:21:37.07,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It was a set of two.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.07,0:21:45.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. We just have to perform\Nlike we always do.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.24,0:21:47.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Just gotta relax.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.92,0:21:57.67,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I made a wish to the stars
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.67,0:22:02.34,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Up in the twinkling sky
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.39,0:22:10.68,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right. This is...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.10,0:22:15.69,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}the song we made...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.82,0:22:19.44,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}when we were little.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.53,0:22:23.66,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Could Fuu...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.82,0:22:26.20,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,{\i1}actually be...
