Dialogue: 2,0:23:01.65,0:23:03.49,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}I'm searching for you{君を探してる}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:03.49,0:23:07.41,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}I'll frame a photo of us two and hang it up{二人映る 額縁(frame)Decorate！}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:07.41,0:23:11.74,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Let's set things the way we want, the way we will, the way they are{思うがまま ワガまま ありのままに並べよう}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.74,0:23:15.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Take our chemistry, plus+, minus-, multiplied×, divided÷ by...{相性 Plus＋ Minus－ Multiply× Divide÷ by…}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.16,0:23:15.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}I love it every way{「全部好き」}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:15.91,0:23:19.25,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Calling me, calling you{Calling me Calling you}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:19.25,0:23:20.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an3\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}(And you){「＆you」}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:19.38,0:23:22.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}I want to walk up the stairs of the future with you{君と歩きたい 未来階段(stairs)}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:22.92,0:23:25.76,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Lucky lucky shiny, our beating hearts dreamin' away{Lucky Lucky Shiny 二人の ときめきDreamin’}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:25.76,0:23:29.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}If there's clear skies tomorrow, everything will be okay{明日晴れなら 万事オーライ}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:29.93,0:23:33.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6}Maybe I'm a bit sad and weak{ちょっとブルー Weakness}
