Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.16,0:23:15.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\c&HF18811&\bord3}I love it every way{「全部好き」}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.91,0:23:19.25,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur0.6\c&HF18811&\bord3}Calling me, calling you{Calling me Calling you}
